WEBVTT

00:02.940 --> 00:04.720
Intruders!

00:05.750 --> 00:06.410
Where are they?

00:06.410 --> 00:07.380
They're above us!

00:07.380 --> 00:08.770
Okay, let's go!

00:08.770 --> 00:09.710
Hurry!

00:10.170 --> 00:11.100
This way!

00:11.100 --> 00:12.240
Go! Go!

00:17.950 --> 00:19.790
Now, answer me.

00:19.790 --> 00:21.330
Are you human, or not?

00:21.330 --> 00:22.110
A demon!

00:22.110 --> 00:23.460
Capture him!

00:26.840 --> 00:28.130
Don't move.

00:29.320 --> 00:31.090
I won't move, then.

00:31.980 --> 00:33.760
{ガイストレーモン}

00:38.730 --> 00:39.810
What is this?

00:39.810 --> 00:41.840
Something feels wrong.

00:41.840 --> 00:44.140
Did time stop?

00:49.760 --> 00:52.780
I've dulled your senses.

00:58.400 --> 01:00.430
Remain still.

01:00.430 --> 01:02.870
Or it might hit somewhere it shouldn't.

01:04.330 --> 01:06.780
Blow, black wind!

01:07.140 --> 01:09.290
{ヴィントブレイカー}

01:12.200 --> 01:13.260
What?

02:49.520 --> 02:54.020
<i>Traitor</i>

02:58.940 --> 03:01.340
Black forces, rage!

03:01.340 --> 03:05.840
{シュバルツプレツセン}

03:12.880 --> 03:16.590
<i>He saved the guard? Why?</i>

03:19.290 --> 03:22.040
<i>I can't move.</i>

03:35.460 --> 03:37.520
Wh-What did you do?

03:37.520 --> 03:40.220
I never did give you my name.

03:40.640 --> 03:45.480
I am the commander of the Demon Lord's 
Seventh Army Corps Undying Brigade, Ike.

03:47.300 --> 03:52.000
<i>This man is a commander in 
the Demon Lord's Army.</i>

03:52.000 --> 03:55.020
<i>The one who protected Ivalias 
with overwhelming power?</i>

03:55.770 --> 03:59.970
You just asked if I was a human.

04:00.570 --> 04:03.800
I am a member of the Demon Lord's army. 
I couldn't possibly be human.

04:06.040 --> 04:07.610
I'll ask again.

04:08.160 --> 04:13.230
During the battle, did you 
send an assassin to kill me?

04:17.000 --> 04:18.650
No answer, huh?

04:19.200 --> 04:21.020
I'm a knight of the Kingdom.

04:21.700 --> 04:23.590
I have nothing to say to you, demon.

04:23.590 --> 04:25.610
If you're going to kill me, then do so.

04:31.870 --> 04:33.410
Mind Reading.

04:39.560 --> 04:41.460
Wh-What are you doing?

04:52.870 --> 04:55.560
Ike-sama! What are you doing?

04:57.520 --> 05:01.000
Why are you flirting with that woman?

05:01.000 --> 05:03.990
You've got me!

05:05.950 --> 05:09.520
If you want to get up-close 
and personal with a girl,

05:09.520 --> 05:12.130
you do it with me any time! Come on!

05:13.680 --> 05:15.780
I'll be going, then.

05:16.950 --> 05:20.270
Ike-sama, don't ignore me.

05:20.270 --> 05:24.840
Don't you want to show the humans 
how much we love each other?

05:25.130 --> 05:26.000
No.

05:28.250 --> 05:29.260
Wait.

05:32.490 --> 05:34.440
You're just going to leave?

05:34.440 --> 05:37.690
Did you come to laugh at me after my defeat?

05:38.210 --> 05:41.190
No. Don't worry.

05:41.840 --> 05:45.530
And you seem to have nothing 
to do with the assassination attempt.

05:47.390 --> 05:49.870
I didn't answer anything.

05:50.620 --> 05:54.890
I read your mind. It was unclouded.

05:57.050 --> 06:02.750
Oh, and as your enemy, I don't know if 
I should say this, but don't be so hard on yourself.

06:04.360 --> 06:07.760
I think what matters is what 
you do after your loss.

06:07.760 --> 06:10.260
What are you saying?

06:10.260 --> 06:11.900
Let's go, Lilith.

06:12.360 --> 06:14.720
We're leaving already?

06:15.130 --> 06:18.740
Want to relax somewhere before we go home?

06:18.740 --> 06:20.510
Why would I?

06:20.510 --> 06:22.690
If you want a rest, rest when we get home.

06:22.930 --> 06:25.820
That's not what I meant!

06:26.420 --> 06:30.910
We're all alone here, so why 
don't we have some fun first?

06:33.720 --> 06:35.930
I don't want to go home.

06:46.000 --> 06:47.880
Welcome back.

06:54.390 --> 06:55.730
Here's a present.

06:55.730 --> 06:57.770
I found this in the capital city of Lazas.

06:59.470 --> 07:02.980
What are these little white things?

07:03.500 --> 07:06.440
It's a food called "rice."

07:07.160 --> 07:09.400
Rice?

07:09.860 --> 07:14.870
You know I've been told to double the amount 
of taxes we receive from this city, right?

07:14.870 --> 07:15.670
Yes.

07:16.140 --> 07:19.870
Ivalias is an agricultural 
city with fertile soil.

07:20.780 --> 07:26.670
Right now they're mostly growing wheat, 
but rice is vastly more productive.

07:28.390 --> 07:30.860
Productive?

07:31.820 --> 07:34.510
I mean that we can grow more rice.

07:35.120 --> 07:39.610
And more productive food means 
we won't need so many farmers.

07:42.270 --> 07:45.440
If those people no longer need to grow food,

07:45.440 --> 07:49.320
and can instead craft things 
like weapons or bricks,

07:49.840 --> 07:53.410
there'll be more people who 
offer them services, as well.

07:54.310 --> 07:57.120
Um... services?

07:57.370 --> 07:59.750
Chefs, for instance.

08:01.200 --> 08:05.170
And having people like that 
is how a country grows rich.

08:05.800 --> 08:06.540
Got it?

08:11.200 --> 08:13.470
Satie, are you okay?

08:14.020 --> 08:17.180
So you're, um, saying...

08:17.920 --> 08:22.890
We'll get to eat lots of food 
and make lots of tax money.

08:23.230 --> 08:24.960
Oh, got it!

08:24.960 --> 08:27.110
You're so smart, Master!

08:27.440 --> 08:30.460
Now, try to cook with this rice.

08:32.240 --> 08:37.030
Um... how do you cook it?

08:37.480 --> 08:40.620
I've never tried it. So I don't know.

08:42.370 --> 08:45.040
There are things you don't know, Master?

08:45.600 --> 08:47.250
I'll leave you in charge.

08:48.010 --> 08:50.210
But I don't know what to do...

08:50.600 --> 08:57.180
All I know is "First low, then high, 
don't remove the lid even if the baby cries."

08:57.450 --> 09:00.540
First low, then high?

09:00.980 --> 09:03.810
Sounds like a magic spell.

09:03.810 --> 09:05.270
I'm counting on you.

09:05.830 --> 09:07.430
Leave it to me.

09:07.430 --> 09:12.110
I'll do everything I can to support you.

09:12.560 --> 09:13.340
Great.

09:14.000 --> 09:16.820
Now, I've got one other important job to do.

09:27.890 --> 09:30.890
Ike-sama, I've brought the army together.

09:30.890 --> 09:32.710
What are we about to do?

09:33.160 --> 09:34.670
You'll know soon.

09:39.010 --> 09:41.450
<i>Putting together all I've learned...</i>

09:42.560 --> 09:46.000
<i>The arrow that someone fired 
belonged to the enemy army.</i>

09:47.040 --> 09:51.060
<i>But Alistair from the White Rose 
Knights knew nothing about it.</i>

09:52.960 --> 09:58.000
<i>Which means someone wanted to attack me</i>

09:58.000 --> 10:01.130
<i>and make it look like it was 
the White Rose Knights.</i>

10:02.330 --> 10:05.460
<i>I didn't want to admit the possibility.</i>

10:06.740 --> 10:09.070
<i>But it looks like that's what it is.</i>

10:10.490 --> 10:12.790
<i>There's a spy in my army.</i>

10:14.420 --> 10:15.960
Mind Reading.

10:19.250 --> 10:21.570
<i>Ike-sama is so amazing!</i>

10:21.570 --> 10:24.820
<i>I want him to read my mind even more!</i>

10:26.510 --> 10:29.390
<i>Jiron needs to be more careful.</i>

10:35.570 --> 10:38.620
<i>Crap. Did they find me?</i>

10:43.640 --> 10:46.050
You're the spy, aren't you?

10:51.890 --> 10:56.090
It's been a long time since you've 
been the one come to see me.

10:59.760 --> 11:02.260
So? What do you want?

11:05.750 --> 11:08.180
You seem like you're in a hurry.

11:08.500 --> 11:11.730
I'm used to it, 
so it doesn't bother me, but...

11:12.330 --> 11:14.620
I'm going to wait outside.

11:15.300 --> 11:17.290
Was there a traitor?

11:18.650 --> 11:19.990
Why do you think so?

11:20.360 --> 11:22.450
Just a feeling.

11:23.510 --> 11:25.700
Do you know who it is?

11:27.090 --> 11:29.160
The second in command of the Seventh Corps.

11:30.230 --> 11:32.360
Jace, the one-eyed goblin.

11:33.830 --> 11:35.420
I see.

11:36.120 --> 11:37.380
Jace, huh?

11:38.250 --> 11:39.740
You're not surprised?

11:39.740 --> 11:41.490
I'd guessed.

11:42.550 --> 11:46.510
Jace is highly intelligent, 
and a veteran warrior.

11:48.990 --> 11:50.930
What should we do now?

11:55.540 --> 11:58.610
There's only one thing we can do.

12:00.930 --> 12:04.530
We'll have to make him pay a price.

12:05.550 --> 12:07.490
What?!

12:07.820 --> 12:10.450
Ike went to see the Commander?

12:10.880 --> 12:12.910
Yes, Jace-sama.

12:13.200 --> 12:16.200
He;s recovered from that 
arrow hit already, huh?

12:16.200 --> 12:18.880
Hey, you didn't screw up, did you?

12:19.230 --> 12:23.340
No, I shot him through the chest.

12:23.670 --> 12:28.560
Jace-sama! I can't get a hold of 
our spy in the Undying Brigade!

12:28.560 --> 12:30.900
What? Damn it!

12:30.900 --> 12:33.020
Have we been found out already?

12:33.020 --> 12:36.400
We'll have to gather our 
forces and attack first!

12:36.400 --> 12:38.850
I won't let it end for me here!

12:38.850 --> 12:40.230
Jace-sama!

12:40.780 --> 12:42.320
Now what?

12:42.320 --> 12:44.700
Ike-sama has come to see you, alone.

12:55.780 --> 12:58.470
You should've told me you were coming.

12:58.960 --> 13:01.570
I happened to be in the area.

13:02.140 --> 13:03.920
And so you came alone?

13:04.270 --> 13:05.080
Yes.

13:06.090 --> 13:07.340
And you...

13:08.440 --> 13:11.350
You've got quite an army with you.

13:13.770 --> 13:15.770
Planning on starting a war?

13:17.040 --> 13:18.880
This is my territory,

13:18.880 --> 13:20.730
so it's none of your business.

13:21.470 --> 13:26.570
Oh, I heard you were 
injured in the last battle.

13:27.150 --> 13:30.000
You probably got careless.

13:30.000 --> 13:32.370
Unacceptable for a brigade commander.

13:32.670 --> 13:36.640
On that point, we can agree.

13:36.640 --> 13:39.080
I should've been more careful.

13:40.540 --> 13:45.250
Yes, especially around potential traitors.

13:47.840 --> 13:49.890
So you know, huh?

13:53.700 --> 13:57.350
So, what are you doing here all by yourself?

14:00.580 --> 14:06.460
As you know, my army has more than 
twice the strength of yours.

14:06.970 --> 14:11.280
My soldiers have all gathered 
here to taste your blood.

14:11.840 --> 14:14.180
You think you can fight them alone?

14:14.180 --> 14:16.500
You really are a fool.

14:17.660 --> 14:19.090
I see.

14:20.100 --> 14:23.880
Your soldiers are all here, yes?

14:26.920 --> 14:28.220
Wh-What?

14:33.340 --> 14:34.970
This can't be...

14:42.290 --> 14:44.320
Darker than the blackest light...

14:44.640 --> 14:47.660
Red lights fall from within the darkness...

14:47.660 --> 14:51.230
A white that brings woe, 
destroying the world...

14:53.370 --> 14:55.220
{メテオシュラーゲン}

14:58.810 --> 15:01.770
Oh, was Ike down there?

15:01.770 --> 15:03.710
Well, I'm sure he'll be fine.

15:05.370 --> 15:07.920
<i>She's just smashing everything again!</i>

15:09.390 --> 15:13.650
<i>I told her to limit her attacks so 
we could rebuild more easily later!</i>

15:15.890 --> 15:18.850
<i>The "price" she's making 
them pay is going too far!</i>

15:21.810 --> 15:24.770
Now, let's start the clean-up.

15:25.580 --> 15:27.720
Don't let even an ant survive.

15:35.000 --> 15:37.120
I'll give you two choices.

15:38.670 --> 15:41.200
Will you surrender now?

15:41.200 --> 15:44.580
Or after you've lost everything?

15:48.200 --> 15:50.510
Kill him, men!

15:50.630 --> 15:52.520
{ヴィントヴエレ}

15:59.230 --> 16:01.240
{シュバルソフアイル}

16:03.650 --> 16:05.110
Jace-sama!

16:05.110 --> 16:07.480
Where are you, Jace-sama?

16:08.690 --> 16:13.580
Your job is to buy time until I escape.

16:17.120 --> 16:20.610
That bitch Cefiro is going to pay!

16:23.680 --> 16:25.750
Damn it!

16:25.750 --> 16:27.350
Don't get in my way!

16:30.670 --> 16:32.010
Fool.

16:33.630 --> 16:35.390
Jace fled!

16:35.390 --> 16:36.590
Find him!

16:43.970 --> 16:46.730
That secret path paid off.

16:49.570 --> 16:51.840
I'll give you the victory this time,

16:51.840 --> 16:55.530
but the real war is just beginning, Cefiro.

16:57.870 --> 16:59.040
Wh-Who's there?

16:59.040 --> 17:01.490
You should know when to 
give up, Vice-Commander.

17:01.490 --> 17:03.280
You...

17:03.280 --> 17:07.580
How did you find this place? 
Only I know about this path!

17:08.040 --> 17:10.550
I had one of them following you.

17:10.800 --> 17:12.050
My familiars.

17:16.610 --> 17:18.930
How dare you get in my way!

17:19.250 --> 17:22.390
Resistance is futile, so please surrender.

17:22.390 --> 17:26.100
Don't tell me what to do, Brigade Commander.

17:26.880 --> 17:30.070
I'm the Vice-Commander of the 
Seventh Corps! Jace-sama!

17:30.650 --> 17:33.030
Your attacks are too weak to break my shield.

17:39.790 --> 17:42.620
All you do is plot. 
It's dulled your combat skills.

17:42.620 --> 17:43.580
Shut up!

17:45.490 --> 17:46.940
What is this?

17:46.940 --> 17:48.580
Binding magic.

17:48.830 --> 17:51.860
Now you can't escape.

17:51.860 --> 17:53.050
It's over.

17:54.740 --> 17:58.010
Fine... I'm sorry.

17:58.520 --> 18:02.470
I can see why the Demon Lord's army 
holds you in such high esteem.

18:03.000 --> 18:06.430
I actually think you've got a lot of talent.

18:07.020 --> 18:10.980
Unstoppable magic, and you're smart, too.

18:10.980 --> 18:12.900
I've got a proposal for you.

18:13.950 --> 18:17.110
Why don't we take over the 
Demon Lord's army together?

18:17.670 --> 18:20.320
Think about it!

18:20.320 --> 18:23.520
We've fought the humans for ages.

18:23.520 --> 18:25.790
But what has the current 
Demon Lord done for us?

18:26.200 --> 18:28.000
We're demons!

18:28.000 --> 18:33.000
Subjugating and attacking humans
 is what gives us joy, right?

18:33.000 --> 18:34.070
But...

18:35.470 --> 18:39.100
The current Demon Lord doesn't 
let us kill for no reason.

18:39.100 --> 18:42.810
There are many of us who don't like that.

18:43.390 --> 18:48.640
I don't know whether our commander 
has no ambitions, or lacks talent...

18:48.640 --> 18:51.350
but she doesn't want to be Demon Lord.

18:52.420 --> 18:55.840
So let's change the Demon Lord's army together!

18:55.840 --> 18:57.070
How about it?

18:57.350 --> 19:02.030
Will you join me... no, us?

19:02.550 --> 19:03.490
I refuse.

19:03.740 --> 19:06.020
I thought so, Ike.

19:06.020 --> 19:08.080
Your life ends here!

19:08.080 --> 19:10.250
{ガイストレーモン}

19:11.990 --> 19:16.670
I thought you were planning 
something, but... was that all?

19:17.920 --> 19:21.020
By the way, you said "us."

19:21.020 --> 19:22.840
So, someone's helping you?

19:24.270 --> 19:25.680
Who's to say?

19:28.620 --> 19:29.810
Commander?

19:30.180 --> 19:31.770
Out with it.

19:33.240 --> 19:36.730
I'll make you speak, even if I have 
to rip apart your brain to do it.

19:36.730 --> 19:38.240
Wait!

19:38.240 --> 19:39.690
I'll handle it my way.

19:40.030 --> 19:42.910
Your methods take too long.

19:43.270 --> 19:44.220
But...

19:47.570 --> 19:48.370
Commander!

19:49.420 --> 19:51.080
I haven't done anything yet.

19:53.790 --> 19:56.500
Then this is poison?

19:56.790 --> 19:58.110
I'll use an antidote spell.

20:00.240 --> 20:01.830
My antidote spell isn't working.

20:02.430 --> 20:06.300
It seems he's been given a powerful poison.

20:07.680 --> 20:12.140
So they poisoned their own comrade? Cowards!

20:16.260 --> 20:17.630
Jace...

20:17.630 --> 20:20.780
You know they've given up on you, right?

20:22.740 --> 20:26.200
There's no need to keep silent 
for their sake, is there?

20:26.700 --> 20:31.160
Tell me their name. I'll get revenge for you.

20:31.690 --> 20:34.120
Their name is...

20:35.700 --> 20:38.090
It's the fate of a traitor,

20:38.910 --> 20:43.040
but seeing him abandoned 
like this makes me pity him.

20:43.040 --> 20:44.670
He deserves it.

20:46.050 --> 20:51.020
<i>Does feeling pity prove 
my heart is still human?</i>

20:52.200 --> 20:56.480
<i>This might come back to haunt me someday.</i>

21:06.160 --> 21:09.240
<i>It seems like things are getting serious.</i>

21:10.290 --> 21:13.960
Cefiro, you know why you're here, right?

21:14.470 --> 21:15.180
Yes.

21:15.780 --> 21:21.340
The one behind this was the head 
of the Third Corps, Basteo.

21:22.930 --> 21:26.090
Do you have proof?

21:26.550 --> 21:31.300
He brought my vice-commander to his side, 
and was planning to kill the two of us,

21:31.300 --> 21:34.060
and you as well.

21:34.680 --> 21:36.020
I see.

21:39.010 --> 21:41.660
That's what Cefiro says.

21:42.150 --> 21:44.270
But what do you have to say?

23:34.300 --> 23:38.810
<i>Duel</i>
